[{"title":"哭刘卿材","author":"金君卿","text":"人皆哭仲途，我独悲卿材。\n仲途于卿材，犹赐也与回。\n回行不可泯，孔弦有馀哀。\n卿材不偶圣，人孰知贤哉。\n龙马驾鼓车，不如一驽骀。\n燕金正挂赏，痛惜骨已埋。\n操舟过君家，登山甫徘徊。\n墓树忽成拱，犯雪色不摧。\n携觞奠其下，洒涕沾苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35973,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留云山居呈长老元禅师","author":"金君卿","text":"衡阳岗阜群龙奔，截起万仞磨天阍。\n宿云收踪著平地，星辰满轩斗可扪。\n河汉鸿涌岩泉喷，六月飞雪冰木根。\n下视吴楚区域分，众山培塿乌足云。\n我来环走竟朝曛，摆脱缰锁忘尘纷。\n更闻高论益清旷，如挹仙袂游昆崙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35974,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题张氏颐文阁","author":"金君卿","text":"鄱阳才子钟庆门，巍冠大带何纷纷。\n诚心乐道自颐养，雾豹蔚彧珍其文。\n朱栏碧瓦江之垠，更敞高阁淩烟氛。\n烟中数岫列窗牖，急雨洗出青无痕。\n乍来耳目益开爽，况日文酒酣天真。\n前年诏下起嵓隐，子直奋起轩浮云。\n不嫌官小喜及养，敛板归拜高堂亲。\n子方归宁亦同乐，与子登眺开芳樽。\n定交酌寿虽所愧，相望兰桂长清芬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35975,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题杨子陆清照亭","author":"金君卿","text":"县舍敌幽居，萧然敞轩槛。\n高迎远峰入，下与新池阚。\n清景月生昼，寒光冰满鉴。\n狎鸟自相得，轻舠不容泛。\n对此须澄心，宜哉水为鉴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35976,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题广信郑倅潜道斋","author":"金君卿","text":"养志浮名外，潜神圣壸中。\n诚心如自得，乐事固无穷。\n斋静横宾榻，诗成促递筒。\n英琼何以报，惟有四般同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35977,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题张秀才此君亭","author":"金君卿","text":"一径入丛深，四轩森翠玉。\n红尘不到处，清秋长在目。\n主人厌薄官，欲蹑高士躅。\n日日念此君，招我湘江曲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35978,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题张秀才此君亭","author":"金君卿","text":"群山四向盘青云，山足一径萦云根。\n拂云截径敞轩槛，槛外百卉铺重茵。\n矜春哆哆弄颜色，散漫红紫何纷纷。\n主人养高不累俗，欲以清节遗子孙。\n剪花芟草植脩竹，半卷画箨含霜筠。\n渐迎风露竟百亩，碧油黕地无纤尘。\n对之气思自潇洒，行吟足以穷朝曛。\n吾居接境未始到，手驰大笔胡能云。\n劝子无渝岁寒操，惟日虚心比此君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35979,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题浮梁县丰乐亭","author":"金君卿","text":"百流南泻昌江浔，涵光吐润生良金。\n从前良令固无几，矧复惠政留于今。\n四十年来耆旧语，李谢刘杨遗爱深。\n高君气象又宏远，能以和易调群心。\n政平讼简日多暇，远嚣淩俗开胸襟。\n旋治东园敞轩闼，四睇环耸千高岑。\n已占溪山足清思，更添桃李成浓阴。\n斯亭不独与民乐，乐得贤者同登临。\n嗟予万里走燕赵，弱羽归飞思故林。\n空吟绝致未能往，徙倚南风聊寄音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35980,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚南黄池村","author":"金君卿","text":"轻风剪烟素，绳绳萦岩阿。\n白鸟相间飞，野容秋外多。\n颓日忽返照，霎若春气和。\n惊帆无落势，又欲冲除过。\n水行本善利，一苇安如梭。\n却笑利名途，甚矣风中波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35981,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清风阁","author":"金君卿","text":"势压最高峰，四轩横断虹。\n江山形胜外，疆埸尽图中。\n景物浩无主，尘襟到即空。\n何须迟炎暑，特地揖清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35982,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清江台","author":"金君卿","text":"贡章湍险吁可惊，岸翻石走轰雷霆。\n崩奔出赣一千里，江势到此才渊渟。\n道山仙府相照映，盘泊下饮苍龙精。\n金沙洗淘洲屿出，红紫错杂围春城。\n郡台峨空压万瓦，况值开霁宜高明。\n老郎官冷厌缰锁，亦有樽酒难独倾。\n旋烹茗粥别官佐，明朝又作新昌行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35983,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩相生日","author":"金君卿","text":"商飙迎素律，兑泽荐元精。\n象顺奎钧烂，天钟义气清。\n千龄将圣偶，冢辅为时生。\n粹蕴森群玉，冲襟贮四瀛。\n大方捐朴斲，淳辨复韶韺。\n先帝龙飞日，朝阳凤一鸣。\n振文齐木铎，保国敌金城。\n旧德方图任，鸿钧正倚平。\n具瞻归峻岳，众口说和羹。\n固结君臣分，穷探礼乐情。\n用人兼畎亩，得士尽豪英。\n省罚蠲茶法，均徭审地征。\n镇浮还美俗，恤隐起疲氓。\n考古渊源博，含章气思宏。\n太平论极至，坠典悉兴行。\n文物期三代，规摹小二京。\n纳忠高子孟，任重等阿衡。\n国本重离正，身谋一羽轻。\n殊方想风烈，皦日照功名。\n嗣圣嘉深识，明神格至诚。\n官仪端表宪，圭瑞竦桓楹。\n邦揆车遵辖，时髦鹿在苹。\n戍亭无警燧，廊庙有奇兵。\n达节天须佑，真儒道始亨。\n黄裳坤德静，玉铉鼎功成。\n坐致唐虞旦，前无丙魏声。\n昌期逢庆诞，睿宠极光荣。\n烨烨台符应，诜诜喜气盈。\n南岩同久固，西昴共晶明。\n史克歌眉寿，芳风愿载赓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35984,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈竹","author":"金君卿","text":"欲知慈姥心，看此矶上竹。\n四时无改易，一节念幽独。\n蟠根石罅牢，倒影潭心绿。\n直恐霜雪姿，化为水苍玉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35985,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僧灵辩南归","author":"金君卿","text":"僧如灵辩者，翘枝秀丛林。\n浩荡游九州，穷奇发清吟。\n巨轴谒明光，朝奏暮拜恩。\n䓞袍拂天香，珍重如腰银。\n逸足不可羁，归云渺无根。\n清明汴口开，一叶东南奔。\n故山盘冰溪，百尺数纤鳞。\n洗耳外名教，洒然鸥鹭群。\n应笑未归客，青衫京洛尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35986,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题胡主簿澄清轩","author":"金君卿","text":"危壁敞新轩，西风满兰芷。\n披襟豁万虑，举目照千里。\n丈夫固有待，澄清不虚纪。\n勾稽职虽贱，为仁决由已。\n芳盛无良苗，源污无洁水。\n愿推天下心，先从邑中始。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35987,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠僧惟益","author":"金君卿","text":"益也非庸僧，黄卷粗渔猎。\n身虽阛阓中，耻与喧嚣接。\n朝弹侧楸局，暮杵青黏叶。\n妙理脱扃键，高谈腾辅颊。\n繄予困缰锁，荏苒沿吏牒。\n不见才七年，霜髭已盈镊。\n借问何所因，苦吟诗满箧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35988,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞","author":"金坚","text":"手翻河汉出天关，雪漱霜飞照眼寒。\n且向亭前供玩好，却来笔底作波澜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35989,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"翠蛟亭","author":"金坚","text":"怒猊抉石骥奔泉，谁挽河流下九天。\n倾泻琼珠三万斛，从师乞作买山钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35990,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送西秦张仲实游大涤洞天","author":"金应桂","text":"山林有真趣，得趣即神仙。\n好趁暮春月，来游大涤天。\n晴岚融玉室，花气袭丹泉。\n此地通悬霤，清吟过叔元。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35991,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕吟","author":"金朋说","text":"银河东达鹊桥西，织女牛郎会晤时。\n才得欢娱又离别，相逢拟待隔年期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35992,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山茶花","author":"金朋说","text":"严寒瑞雪正飘飘，布满乾坤似玉浇。\n独见墙头倾赤艳，鲜红几朵破琼瑶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35993,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五季石晋 其二","author":"金朋说","text":"石晋尊夷取帝华，如何两世覆邦家。\n杀胡林下天还报，剖腹盐心归帝羓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35994,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五季石晋 其一","author":"金朋说","text":"父礼契丹输左衽，尊夷割地表称臣。\n降戎借势冠裳倒，万古春秋一罪人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35995,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五季梁主","author":"金朋说","text":"弑君杀父乱纲常，弟戮其兄促灭亡。\n上下交征仁义绝，背违天理应难昌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35996,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乐渔吟","author":"金朋说","text":"桃花涧底频垂钓，蓼子滩头稳系舟。\n取得鱼来换美酒，清风明月兴悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35997,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乐樵吟","author":"金朋说","text":"木美牛山斤斧息，烂柯林下度长年。\n有时岩底问渔者，利害相论理豁然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35998,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日幽居","author":"金朋说","text":"炉煨榾柮雪煎茶，松竹环居耐岁华。\n窗外玉梅疏弄影，助人诗兴两三花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":35999,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬雪吟","author":"金朋说","text":"彤云垂四野，六出舞漫天。\n却笑广文郑，严寒无坐毡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36000,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"司马昭弑魏主","author":"金朋说","text":"曹操师模司马昭，镕成成弑济君刀。\n恢恢天网原无漏，报施何曾差一毫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36001,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自欺吟","author":"金朋说","text":"揠苗昧所养，乞祭骄其妻。\n诡遇得禽者，宁无惭嬖奚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36002,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张忠靖","author":"金朋说","text":"尽职倾忠世所稀，舍生取义重伦彝。\n昭昭名节标青史，万古流芳天下奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36003,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戒五荒","author":"金朋说","text":"重色耽沉湎，娱音乐侈华。\n禽荒迷不返，未有不亡家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36004,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"折槛吟","author":"金朋说","text":"折槛当年世丈夫，上方谁肯借昆吾。\n虽然未克诛奸佞，万古人臣可范模。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36005,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李绛裴度","author":"金朋说","text":"辅主中兴划懋功，削平僣叛一循公。\n自怜党起群邪进，王业萧条不克终。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36006,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李密陈情表","author":"金朋说","text":"乌鸟私情虽孝恳，谀人藐主岂忠诚。\n堂堂大汉天潢派，何必陈情以伪名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36007,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李谪仙","author":"金朋说","text":"笔端文彩辉星斗，怀抱诗豪泣鬼神。\n超迈英才贯绝世，明皇宠异贵无伦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36008,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨贵妃","author":"金朋说","text":"倾国娇容启色荒，能移帝主堕三纲。\n荔枝嚬笑虽甘美，马践嵬坡促命亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36009,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹吟","author":"金朋说","text":"娇姿艳质号花王，魏砌姚阶羡紫黄。\n更有一株何处种，天然标格出扶桑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36010,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芸禾吟","author":"金朋说","text":"芸禾雨苦连，草秽何能蠲。\n借问司农者，俱云不得天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36011,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤壁鏖兵","author":"金朋说","text":"西北楼船烈焰中，周瑜于此破曹公。\n孙郎不是刘豚犬，百万兵消一阵风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36012,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲居吟","author":"金朋说","text":"斗室安居广，炉香乐性闲。\n不欺幽独境，无愧两仪间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36013,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闵子骞","author":"金朋说","text":"名称大孝世之难，袄絮芦花岂耐寒。\n宁使一身甘冻死，肯教三子受衣单。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36014,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏朱默斋山茶花","author":"金朋说","text":"谁掇孤根墙角栽，天然秾艳衬瑶台。\n岁寒松柏如相问，一点丹红雪里开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36015,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建康怀古","author":"金朋说","text":"石头城下炬烧寒，司马东来骨肉残。\n可惜六朝花粉地，年年风雨草漫漫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36016,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苻坚伐晋","author":"金朋说","text":"南国山河不易图，投鞭欲使断江流。\n骄兵百万填淝水，狼狈归来国已休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36017,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茉莉吟","author":"金朋说","text":"一种秋容淡素妆，西风吹破几枝芳。\n琼葩玉蕊金飙夜，疑是梅花入梦香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36018,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幽居吟","author":"金朋说","text":"种竹为垣护草堂，面山临水纳幽芳。\n从容泉石无牵绊，不似从前志庙廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36019,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春山吟","author":"金朋说","text":"岧峣嫩绿间妖红，碧树琼花潋滟中。\n一段天机犹织就，宜为宅畔锦屏风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36020,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日吟","author":"金朋说","text":"柳塘花坞矮垣墙，帘捲东风砌草芳。\n天理流行随处见，盈虚伸缩可消详。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36021,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"省斋吟","author":"金朋说","text":"修己师曾子，为人谋必忠。\n信诚交以道，传习熟加工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36022,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种竹吟","author":"金朋说","text":"种竹清无俗，虚心耐岁寒。\n凭窗风日爽，诗酒可盘桓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36023,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种柳吟","author":"金朋说","text":"种柳护吾庐，无妨隐者居。\n绿酬一樽酒，青映五车书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36024,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种梅吟","author":"金朋说","text":"栽梅沿屋角，幽趣少人知。\n雪后月明夜，孤芳吐几枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36025,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种菊吟","author":"金朋说","text":"众卉竞春妍，芬芳无彼此。\n霜寒摇落时，独秀何如尔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36026,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荀彧饮药","author":"金朋说","text":"管仲尊周昔相桓，当年文若附曹瞒。\n匡朝宁国言虽正，始比高光孰发端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36027,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐文宗 其二","author":"金朋说","text":"贤良策举厌刘蕡，报献徒悲自比伦。\n直疏李邵言不用，宁从甘露祸金门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36028,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐文宗 其一","author":"金朋说","text":"耻为凡主冀明良，摈出贤才事可伤。\n若用刘蕡救时策，何须醇酒烂霞觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36029,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐宣宗饵药","author":"金朋说","text":"长生妄诞诳愚言，覆辙前途不自悛。\n若饵金丹人不死，北邙青冢尽神仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36030,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐阉宦","author":"金朋说","text":"握兵定策擅朝权，天子门生任劫迁。\n教党愚君为得志，他年类灭是谁愆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36031,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐敬宗","author":"金朋说","text":"丹扆六箴真药石，童君不饵夭天年。\n宴游亵狎比群小，灭烛筵边血溅鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36032,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐穆宗","author":"金朋说","text":"燥发金丹柳泌诛，长生妙药已成虚。\n穆宗心眼何昏惑，不省张皋覆辙书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36033,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日幽居","author":"金朋说","text":"小隐楼台绿树中，藕塘花艳散香风。\n纶巾羽扇薰风坐，逸兴飘飘迥不同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36034,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"积学吟","author":"金朋说","text":"莠除苗自长，醅化醴方醇。\n学至盎然后，眼前皆是春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36035,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诸葛武侯","author":"金朋说","text":"南阳高卧隐人龙，出处躬耕莘野同。\n讨贼祁山声大义，至今史册播丹忠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36036,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悉怛谋降唐","author":"金朋说","text":"祖宗疆域陷西戎，得复来归悉怛谋。\n不受生降唯守信，死年褒赠复何忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36037,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花吟","author":"金朋说","text":"傲雪含芳破五花，水村山郭傍诗家。\n本为金鼎调羹物，寥落山林老岁华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36038,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菊花吟","author":"金朋说","text":"金葩玉蕊破寒霜，北径东篱艳吐芳。\n自惜彊腰翁去后，几人能共对重阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36039,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪山","author":"金朋说","text":"耸翠摩苍列画图，彤云作雪满天铺。\n青山莫谓长无老，一夜飞琼尽白颅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36040,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游山吟","author":"金朋说","text":"蹑屐山行日看花，春前桃李属谁家。\n千红万紫争妍媚，不似青松耐岁华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36041,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋归吟","author":"金朋说","text":"松菊存陶径，弦歌绝武城。\n江东新发棹，僮仆笑相迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36042,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赏李吟","author":"金朋说","text":"雅缀琼林伴召棠，梨花综错影琳琅。\n惭无廊庙调羹味，莫惜区区弃路旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36043,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赏松吟","author":"金朋说","text":"岩谷虽芜松尚存，溪门僮仆伺朝昏。\n林泉清兴真飘逸，月满轩窗酒满樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36044,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]